Z||000008||Seanh||11-01-2000||04:52 PM||||Okay. I got your email 1FST and I will try and get them up either today or tomarrow. Like I said, I am working on a new setup with dynamic html support, but I am not very quick at writing things like that. As for the car, I "sold" my tiwn turbo fiero. Never to return, unless...nevermind. It always a possibilty, I do have a twin turbo setup for a talon, just never taken the energy to try it on a Fiero. I have purchased an 85 SE with a 2.5 engine not running. It is just sitting in the grauge and I probally wont get started on it until March or somthing. Depends how sick I am of Fieros after rebuilding mine and doing a 3.4 in it. I dont know why you browser craped out on the projects page, but I cant help much since I use IE. There is really nothing outstanding on that page the might cause a fault, but who knows? Has anyone else had any trouble with it? Thanks<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/singnit3_1.gif">   <BR>Sean Heberly<BR>Silver 86 GT 2.8<BR>Killer Stereo System||||reg||1
