Z||000010||Seanh||11-01-2000||06:18 PM||||Yeah, I live in North Platte. I knew you were from Lincoln, but I didnt know of Bugsy. Where does he live? Those were my intensions for getting the nebraskafieros.com name. I am just going to host my page on there for now, and let people know I would like to get a club together in Nebraska. Im glad I am not the only one with the idea. Might be a while before we can find many members. I only know of us three and one other person in Lincoln that ownes Fieros. I know a couple here that also own Fieros, but they think of the car as only a method of transportation, so I dont associate much with them. There was a police officer that owned a nice Fiero here and he just sold it to another person I have yet to meet. I am going to talk when I see them next.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/singnit3_1.gif">   <BR>Sean Heberly<BR>Silver 86 GT 2.8<BR>Killer Stereo System||||reg||1
